          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your turn begins.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Unconscious] and have the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dying] condition.</p><hr /><p>The crossroads between life and death is a place that can reveal many secrets. You gain the effects of an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Augury] spell in a strange, near-death vision. Empowered by the realization, you then lose the dying condition (becoming @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Wounded]{Wounded 1} or increasing your wounded value by 1, as normal), regain @Damage[2*@actor.level[healing]] Hit Points, and can Stand.</p>"
